  translation {
    text: "Affected northbound trips:\r\n4:39 pm from Florida Station to 18th & California Station\r\n6:39 pm from Florida Station to 18th & California Station\r\n8:39 pm from Florida Station to 18th & California Station\r\n10:39 pm from Florida Station to 18th & California Station\r\n\nAffected southbound trips:\r\n5:30 pm from 18th & Stout Station to Florida Station\r\n7:30 pm from 18th & Stout Station to Florida Station\r\n9:30 pm from 18th & Stout Station to Florida Station\r\n11:30 pm from 18th & Stout Station to Florida Station"
